            <description><![CDATA[按功能分类的MATLAB函数参考指南]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="1-语言基础">1. 语言基础<a href="https://ztqsqq.github.io/function/%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0#1-%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 1. 语言基础" title="Direct link to 1. 语言基础">​</a></h2>
<div style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px"><h3>命令行控制</h3><table><thead><tr><th>函数名</th><th>说明</th><th>示例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>clc</code></td><td>清空命令行窗口</td><td><pre>clc
% 清空当前终端内容</pre></td></tr><tr><td><code>format</code></td><td>设置输出显示格式</td><td><pre>format long
% 改为长精度显示</pre></td></tr><tr><td><code>diary</code></td><td>记录会话到文件</td><td><pre>diary log.txt
% 开始记录到文件</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px"><h3>帮助系统</h3><table><thead><tr><th>函数名</th><th>说明</th><th>示例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>doc</code></td><td>打开函数文档页</td><td><pre>doc plot
% 查看plot函数文档</pre></td></tr><tr><td><code>help</code></td><td>命令行快速帮助</td><td><pre>help sprintf
% 显示简要用法</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="2-矩阵与数组">2. 矩阵与数组<a href="https://ztqsqq.github.io/function/%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0#2-%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 2. 矩阵与数组" title="Direct link to 2. 矩阵与数组">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="21-创建矩阵">2.1 创建矩阵<a href="https://ztqsqq.github.io/function/%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0#21-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 2.1 创建矩阵" title="Direct link to 2.1 创建矩阵">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-matlab codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-matlab codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% 创建3x3单位矩阵</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">A = eye(3); </span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% 生成对角矩阵</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">B = diag([1 2 3]);</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% 水平拼接矩阵</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">C = horzcat(A, B);</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="22-矩阵运算">2.2 矩阵运算<a href="https://ztqsqq.github.io/function/%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0#22-%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 2.2 矩阵运算" title="Direct link to 2.2 矩阵运算">​</a></h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>函数</th><th>说明</th><th>示例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>inv</code></td><td>矩阵求逆</td><td><code>inv(A)</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>eig</code></td><td>特征值分解</td><td><code>[V,D] = eig(A)</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>norm</code></td><td>矩阵/向量范数</td><td><code>norm(A, 'fro')</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="3-可视化函数">3. 可视化函数<a href="https://ztqsqq.github.io/function/%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0#3-%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%86%E5%8C%96%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3. 可视化函数" title="Direct link to 3. 可视化函数">​</a></h2>
<div class="tabs-container tabList__CuJ"><ul role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="tabs"><li role="tab" tabindex="0" aria-selected="true" class="tabs__item tabItem_LNqP tabs__item--active">二维绘图</li><li role="tab" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false" class="tabs__item tabItem_LNqP">三维绘图</li></ul><div class="margin-top--md"><div role="tabpanel" class="tabItem_Ymn6"><div class="language-matlab codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-matlab codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% 基础折线图</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">x = 0:0.1:2*pi;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">plot(x, sin(x), title('Sine Wave');</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% 散点图矩阵</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">scatter(rand(100,1), rand(100,1));</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div></div><div role="tabpanel" class="tabItem_Ymn6" hidden=""><div class="language-matlab codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-matlab codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">[X,Y] = meshgrid(-2:.2:2);</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">Z = X .* exp(-X.^2 - Y.^2);</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">surf(X,Y,Z);</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="4-函数速查表">4. 函数速查表<a href="https://ztqsqq.github.io/function/%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0#4-%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 4. 函数速查表" title="Direct link to 4. 函数速查表">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="按首字母检索">按首字母检索<a href="https://ztqsqq.github.io/function/%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0#%E6%8C%89%E9%A6%96%E5%AD%97%E6%AF%8D%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 按首字母检索" title="Direct link to 按首字母检索">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-matlab codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-matlab codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">%% A</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% abs    - 绝对值</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% angle  - 相位角</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">%% B</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% bar    - 柱状图</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">% bessel - 贝塞尔函数</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr>
<blockquote>
<p>📌 <strong>使用提示</strong>：</p>
<ol>
<li>在MATLAB命令行输入 <code>help 函数名</code> 获取详细帮助</li>
<li>按 <code>Tab</code> 键可自动补全函数名</li>
<li>使用 <code>which 函数名</code> 查看函数路径</li>
</ol>
</blockquote>
